{
    "title": "CEX.IO App - Buy Crypto & BTC",
    "description": "The CEX.IO App provides the ultimate crypto experience, with a variety of services in the palm of your hand. Our app empowers you to trade, sell, and buy Bitcoin and other cryptocurrencies instantly, anytime, and anywhere. Spend less than a minute to buy Ethereum and other digital assets using a debit/credit card, Apple Pay, bank transfers, and/or PayPal*. In addition, with the CEX.IO App, you have access to 300+ markets wherever you go.\r\n\r\nUsing the funding method that suits you best, you can instantly buy or sell the following assets via the CEX.IO App:\r\n\r\nBitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), Bitcoin Cash (BCH), Polygon (MATIC), Litecoin (LTC), Ripple (XRP), Stellar (XLM), Cosmos (ATOM), Dogecoin (DOGE), Shiba Inu (SHIB), Cardano (ADA), USD Coin (USDC), Tether (USDT), Polkadot (DOT), Uniswap (UNI), Zilliqa (ZIL), SushiSwap (SUSHI), and Solana (SOL).\r\n\r\nThese are just a few of the 100+ supported digital assets! And we\u2019re constantly expanding our listings.\r\n\r\nThe CEX.IO App opens access to the entire universe of crypto services. Apart from your own Bitcoin wallet, other attractive features include:\r\n\u2022 Instant crypto purchases. Buy crypto in a few taps, using the funding method that best suits your needs.\r\n\u2022 Instant Sell option. Convert your crypto into fiat, and immediately send funds to your payment card.\r\n\u2022 Rapid card deposits and withdrawals. Deposit funds to your CEX.IO balance, or transfer fiat to your debit/credit card in minutes.\r\n\u2022 Multichain support. Send Bitcoin and other digital assets using 40+ blockchain networks.\r\n\u2022 Beginner-friendly Convert feature. No need to figure out trading strategies. Just swap crypto and fiat currencies in a few taps.\r\n\u2022 Crypto savings accounts**. Accumulate daily crypto rewards in Bitcoin, Ethereum, and other digital assets, with no lock-up periods.\r\n\u2022 Deep liquidity. Trade 300+ markets with narrow spreads, and minimal price slippage.\r\n\u2022 Sub-accounts for trading. Improve risk management of your trading strategy and better organize your finances, taking advantage of up to five sub-accounts.\r\n\u2022 Save your favorite markets. Select preferred currency pairs for quick access and decision-making.\r\n\u2022 Monitor your portfolio performance. Track the slightest changes in your crypto wallet and trading balances.\r\n\u2022 User-friendly interface. Purchase, sell, exchange, and store crypto, enjoying intuitive app navigation.\r\n\u2022 Fast card-linking. Add your payment card to buy cryptocurrency in a matter of minutes.\r\n\u2022 Detailed order and transaction history. Stay informed of your crypto exchange operations, with clear explanations of all fees and commissions.\r\n\u2022 Passionate Support Team, which is eager to provide professional assistance throughout your crypto journey. \r\n\r\nWith CEX.IO\u2019s cryptocurrency exchange, you can take advantage of a wide array of currency pairs, deep liquidity, and an advanced order-matching mechanism. With this crypto app, we combined the best CEX.IO ecosystem features, and packed them into a straightforward interface. Our cryptocurrency trading platform empowers you to achieve fast execution of your trades, while our Savings** service provides you with the opportunity to earn crypto effortlessly.\r\n\r\nWant to buy or sell crypto, in a matter of minutes? You can do it with the CEX.IO App. Want to build your own trading strategy, and track its performance? This app is the one for which you\u2019ve been looking. Enjoy these and many other features our crypto exchange has to offer, by downloading the CEX.IO App\r\n\r\n*Payment methods available depend on the user's country of residence.\r\n**Availability of the CEX.IO Savings service depends on the user\u2019s jurisdiction.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Not investment or financial advice. Seek professional advice. Digital assets involve risk. Do your own research.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The CEX.IO App provides the ultimate crypto experience, with a variety of services in the palm of your hand. Our app empowers you to trade, sell, and buy Bitcoin and other cryptocurrencies instantly, anytime, and anywhere. Spend less than a minute to buy Ethereum and other digital assets using a debit/credit card, Apple Pay, bank transfers, and/or PayPal*. In addition, with the CEX.IO App, you have access to 300+ markets wherever you go.<br><br>Using the funding method that suits you best, you can instantly buy or sell the following assets via the CEX.IO App:<br><br>Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), Bitcoin Cash (BCH), Polygon (MATIC), Litecoin (LTC), Ripple (XRP), Stellar (XLM), Cosmos (ATOM), Dogecoin (DOGE), Shiba Inu (SHIB), Cardano (ADA), USD Coin (USDC), Tether (USDT), Polkadot (DOT), Uniswap (UNI), Zilliqa (ZIL), SushiSwap (SUSHI), and Solana (SOL).<br><br>These are just a few of the 100+ supported digital assets! And we\u2019re constantly expanding our listings.<br><br>The CEX.IO App opens access to the entire universe of crypto services. Apart from your own Bitcoin wallet, other attractive features include:<br>\u2022 Instant crypto purchases. Buy crypto in a few taps, using the funding method that best suits your needs.<br>\u2022 Instant Sell option. Convert your crypto into fiat, and immediately send funds to your payment card.<br>\u2022 Rapid card deposits and withdrawals. Deposit funds to your CEX.IO balance, or transfer fiat to your debit/credit card in minutes.<br>\u2022 Multichain support. Send Bitcoin and other digital assets using 40+ blockchain networks.<br>\u2022 Beginner-friendly Convert feature. No need to figure out trading strategies. Just swap crypto and fiat currencies in a few taps.<br>\u2022 Crypto savings accounts**. Accumulate daily crypto rewards in Bitcoin, Ethereum, and other digital assets, with no lock-up periods.<br>\u2022 Deep liquidity. Trade 300+ markets with narrow spreads, and minimal price slippage.<br>\u2022 Sub-accounts for trading. Improve risk management of your trading strategy and better organize your finances, taking advantage of up to five sub-accounts.<br>\u2022 Save your favorite markets. Select preferred currency pairs for quick access and decision-making.<br>\u2022 Monitor your portfolio performance. Track the slightest changes in your crypto wallet and trading balances.<br>\u2022 User-friendly interface. Purchase, sell, exchange, and store crypto, enjoying intuitive app navigation.<br>\u2022 Fast card-linking. Add your payment card to buy cryptocurrency in a matter of minutes.<br>\u2022 Detailed order and transaction history. Stay informed of your crypto exchange operations, with clear explanations of all fees and commissions.<br>\u2022 Passionate Support Team, which is eager to provide professional assistance throughout your crypto journey. <br><br>With CEX.IO\u2019s cryptocurrency exchange, you can take advantage of a wide array of currency pairs, deep liquidity, and an advanced order-matching mechanism. With this crypto app, we combined the best CEX.IO ecosystem features, and packed them into a straightforward interface. Our cryptocurrency trading platform empowers you to achieve fast execution of your trades, while our Savings** service provides you with the opportunity to earn crypto effortlessly.<br><br>Want to buy or sell crypto, in a matter of minutes? You can do it with the CEX.IO App. Want to build your own trading strategy, and track its performance? This app is the one for which you\u2019ve been looking. Enjoy these and many other features our crypto exchange has to offer, by downloading the CEX.IO App<br><br>*Payment methods available depend on the user&#39;s country of residence.<br>**Availability of the CEX.IO Savings service depends on the user\u2019s jurisdiction.<br><br>Disclaimer: Not investment or financial advice. Seek professional advice. Digital assets involve risk. Do your own research.",
